<?xml version="1.0"?>
<classes>
  <point name="nod_scene" color="0.6 0.6 0.6" box="-4 -4 -4 4 4 4">
Source binding for NODscene. Do not edit or delete.
    <string key="nod_id" name="Stable identity">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_schema" name="Schema version">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_sources" name="Source checksums">Read-only.</string>
  </point>
  <point name="nod_nil_sector" color="0.2 0.7 1" box="-8 -8 -8 8 8 8">
Read-only NIL sector center and metadata. This is not a sector volume.
    <string key="nod_id" name="Stable sector identity">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_flags" name="Sector flags">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_portals" name="Portal count">Read-only; portal connectivity remains in the sidecar.</string>
  </point>
  <point name="nod_nsd_entity" color="1 0.6 0.2" box="-8 -8 -8 8 8 8">
Tagged native NSD entity. origin is world-space XYZ. Only origin, nod_rotation,
and an existing nod_sector property are editable. Native model references are
metadata, not Radiant-loadable model files. Trigger volumes/scripts remain opaque.
    <string key="nod_id" name="Stable source identity">Read-only source byte offset.</string>
    <string key="nod_type" name="Native entity type">Read-only; no Quake gameplay mapping.</string>
    <string key="nod_rotation" name="Native rotation">Three native Euler components, in original order.</string>
    <string key="nod_sector" name="Native sector index">Editable if present; zero-based NIL sector index.</string>
    <string key="nod_model" name="Native NOD/NMB reference">Read-only; use NODscene preview for verified asset lookup.</string>
    <string key="nod_preview_status" name="Preview resolution status">Read-only; unresolved records remain native points.</string>
    <string key="nod_region_class" name="Native region class">Read-only; region geometry is not decoded.</string>
  </point>
  <point name="misc_model" color="1 0.6 0.2" box="-8 -8 -8 8 8 8">
NODscene editor alias for exactly one native NSD entity, not a Quake gameplay
entity. Editable fields: origin, angles, and existing nod_sector. The model is an
unanimated native NOD/NMB reference under NOD Authoring, at scale 1. NIL world
and legacy previews use OBJ. Do not add/delete aliases or edit scales/remaps.
Exception: nod_id "nil:world" and nod_role "nil_geometry" identify the static
NIL world preview. ALL its fields, including origin and angles, are read-only.
    <string key="nod_id" name="Stable source identity">Read-only NSD byte offset or nil:world.</string>
    <string key="nod_role" name="Preview role">Read-only; nil_geometry identifies immutable NIL geometry.</string>
    <string key="nod_type" name="Native entity type">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="angles" name="Editor rotation">Editable GtkRadiant rotation, converted back to native orientation.</string>
    <string key="nod_rotation" name="Original native rotation">Read-only; edit angles instead.</string>
    <string key="nod_sector" name="Native sector index">Editable only if already present.</string>
    <string key="model" name="Native or NIL preview model">Read-only; mount native assets alongside the editor game root.</string>
    <string key="_frame" name="NMB member index">Read-only zero-based member index; NOD/NIL world use 0.</string>
    <string key="nod_model" name="Native direct model reference">Read-only; present for nonempty NSD overrides.</string>
    <string key="nod_reference" name="Resolved native reference">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_asset" name="Native catalog asset">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_member" name="Exact NMB member">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_provenance" name="Reference provenance">Read-only NOT property or NSD tag.</string>
    <string key="nod_asset_crc" name="Native asset checksum">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_preview_status" name="Preview resolution status">Read-only.</string>
    <string key="nod_region_class" name="Native region class">Read-only if present; region bounds remain opaque.</string>
  </point>
  <point name="nod_npd_waypoint" color="0.2 1 0.4" box="-4 -4 -4 4 4 4">
NPD waypoint in native NAVIGATION space, NOT NIL/NSD world space.
Editable fields: origin, nod_flags, nod_color, nod_extra. Do not add/delete nodes.
    <string key="nod_id" name="Stable record identity">Read-only zero-based record index.</string>
    <string key="nod_space" name="Coordinate space">Read-only; navigation.</string>
    <string key="nod_waypoint_id" name="Native waypoint ID">Read-only; not an NSD entity reference.</string>
    <string key="nod_flags" name="Raw waypoint flags">Unsigned 16-bit value; semantics are not fully decoded.</string>
    <string key="nod_color" name="Raw debug color">Unsigned 32-bit packed color, decimal.</string>
    <string key="nod_extra" name="Raw extra fields">Three unsigned 16-bit values.</string>
  </point>
  <point name="nod_npd_link" color="0.4 0.7 0.4" box="-2 -2 -2 2 2 2">
Native NPD adjacency record. These metadata markers are placed at the origin;
they do not draw graph edges. Do not add/delete link records.
    <string key="nod_id" name="Stable link identity">Read-only adjacency record index.</string>
    <string key="nod_from" name="From record index">Editable zero-based waypoint record index, not waypoint ID.</string>
    <string key="nod_to" name="To record index">Editable zero-based waypoint record index, not waypoint ID.</string>
    <string key="nod_cost" name="Raw edge cost">Editable unsigned 16-bit value.</string>
  </point>
</classes>
